# The coverage store is large raw collector output, regenerable from the MB
# dumps plus the committed census scripts (the REL- template). It is ACTIVE
# machine-local state, not a frozen record — see README.md, and do NOT let a
# scratchpad clean take it: regenerating costs ~1 h of dump passes, which is
# exactly the cost ULC-F2 exists to stop re-paying.
ulf_coverage.json
# Pre-run backups of the store, same class as the store itself: a census
# WRITES BACK, so taking one before a run is the cheap way to keep the hour
# it would cost to regenerate. Ignored for the same reason the store is.
ulf_coverage.json.*
*.log
__pycache__/
